			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/113-madonna-and-lourdes-material-girl-fashion-label-turned-one.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Madonna</strong> commemorated the event with a cool party and fashion show at <strong>Macy's</strong> in <strong>New York City</strong>. The anniversary was also promoted on <strong>Madonna</strong>'s Facebook page.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Among the celebrities were <strong>Lourdes</strong> and <strong>Kelly Osbourne</strong>. Lola, dress in yellow mini skirt, high heels and flaming red lipstick, absolutely captured the spotlight and dominated the catwalk!</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> was there but, she wanted to leave the spotlight to her daughter and <strong>Kelly Osbourne</strong>.</p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>Material Girl</li><li>Lourdes</li><li>Kelly Osbourne</li><ul></div>]]></description>
